## llm metadata in commit messages ##
##
## one shared list for the commit-msg hook [ fresh commits ] and the
## harmonize-emails history rewrite [ msg-filter ], both applied through
## bin/dev/strip-llm-metadata
##
##   <action> <perl regex, matched against each message line>
##
##   line   : the whole line is removed
##   prefix : only the matched text is removed, the rest of the line stays

line    ^\s*Co-Authored-By:
line    ^\s*Claude-Session:
line    \p{Emoji}\s*Generated with\s
line    ^\s*Generated with \[?Claude Code
line    \[Claude Code\] \([^\)]+\)\s*$
prefix  ^\[CLAUDE\]\s+
